Node ID=30 Rites Confession Train
Text=Ah! A new empty vessel into which the knowledge of the Confessional can be poured. The first step is one of my favorites...examining the demons within. The cells in here are filled with some of the more tainted elements of society. Examine them freely, but be careful. Their stories are meant to confuse your soul...do not listen to them, just pay attention to yourself.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=31 Rites Confession continue
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=31 Rites Confession continue
Text=Know that when your heart feels compassion, it is their magic at work. It can be quite a surge of power to quell their control over you! Take these keys and examine one up close if you must, but be not concerned if you haven't the strength to open its cell. These are mean demons, through and through. Think of this as a test...I will not save you if they attack. Trial by fire is the best way to achieve saintliness.
Should Have Voiceover=0

